  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">International Business College in Mitrovica IBCM - Procurement support HIfab</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">International Business College in Mitrovica IBCM</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">SPARK driver projektet International Business College Mitrovica IBCM. Sida har st&#xf6;tt projektet sedan dess start 2008. M&#xe5;let &#xe4;r att &#xf6;ka      anst&#xe4;llningsbarheten/entrepen&#xf6;rsandan bland ungdomar fr&#xe5;n olika       etniska och socioekonomiska grupper i Kosovo och att bidra till en    &#xf6;kad andel unga med relevant h&#xf6;gre yrkesutbildning anpassad till ett  framtida EU medlemskap.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SPARK implements the project International Business College in Mitrovica IBCM. Sida has been supported this project since it started in 2008.The objectives are to improve employability/self-employment   among youth from different ethnic and socioeconomic groups in Kosovo  and to contribute to enhanced higher vocational training              opportunities adapted to a future EU membership.</narrative>
  </description>
